      "w": 640,
      "h": 127,
      "state": {
        "Text": "08 \u2014 SECURITY TOOLKIT\n\nA private CA and a certificate it issues, a CSR, a message signed and a tampered copy rejected, a JWT made and decoded, 2FA codes with the setup QR code read back, a webhook HMAC, AES, BCrypt and PBKDF2, and an API key from a GUID and a random string.\n\nPress Run Once (Ctrl\u002BR) and read the Outputs. Each task sits in its own group; collapse the ones you are not reading (double-click a header)."
      }
    }
